    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25NEOLITHIC DAWN - EARLY ACCESS!\ud83d\udd25</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate primitive survival experience! Step into the shoes of a Neolithic hunter-gatherer and struggle to survive in a harsh and unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an ancient ice age civilization alone with your tribe, craft any tool you can imagine to hunt and tame Ice Age creatures to help you survive on a journey your whole family tree will push through across 5 large open world maps each with its own unique dungeon to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2620\ufe0f Generations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a real-time day night cycle, dynamic seasons, and generational changes! When your character dies, your journey will resume 20 years in the future, after your child has grown up you will live on in a world changed by the passage of time and your actions in your past life. See how the world changes as hundreds of years build up behind you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Tame Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any animal you see may become a powerful ally in the wilderness, provided you have the strength to impress them and ingenuity to live alongside them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Physics-Based Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create whatever you can out of what you find. Anything you can imagine is possible when you build stone tools with your own two hands, the true caveman way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Also Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Impossible World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neolithic Dawn Take place in a recreation of a real world location with a secret world to uncover. Learn the ways of the past, reconnect with your ancestors, and discover the supernatural beauty of a fallen civilization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even more fun when you bring your friends and face the wilderness together! Meet new people in the social Campfire Hangout mode or Journey through through the story together in CO-OP with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neolithic Dawn is built by a small team with a big dream. By launching in Early Access we hope to finish building the game alongside the community so we can build the greatest VR survival game together! \ud83d\udcaa</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25NEOLITHIC DAWN - EARLY ACCESS!\ud83d\udd25</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate primitive survival experience! Step into the shoes of a Neolithic hunter-gatherer and struggle to survive in a harsh and unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an ancient ice age civilization alone with your tribe, craft any tool you can imagine to hunt and tame Ice Age creatures to help you survive on a journey your whole family tree will push through across 5 large open world maps each with its own unique dungeon to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2620\ufe0f Generations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a real-time day night cycle, dynamic seasons, and generational changes! When your character dies, your journey will resume 20 years in the future, after your child has grown up you will live on in a world changed by the passage of time and your actions in your past life. See how the world changes as hundreds of years build up behind you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/71d86ed1d45657afb2bd46c0d1cfd1ae.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Tame Anything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any animal you see may become a powerful ally in the wilderness, provided you have the strength to impress them and ingenuity to live alongside them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/b0d58b2587f9253b240c9b99b3abf636.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Physics-Based Crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create whatever you can out of what you find. Anything you can imagine is possible when you build stone tools with your own two hands, the true caveman way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.poster.avif?t=1754889244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.webm?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018960/extras/761a2daf7aa5b7bb606501400ee10c0c.mp4?t=1754889244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Also Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Impossible World</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neolithic Dawn Take place in a recreation of a real world location with a secret world to uncover. Learn the ways of the past, reconnect with your ancestors, and discover the supernatural beauty of a fallen civilization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up to 4 Player CO-OP</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even more fun when you bring your friends and face the wilderness together! Meet new people in the social Campfire Hangout mode or Journey through through the story together in CO-OP with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neolithic Dawn is built by a small team with a big dream. By launching in Early Access we hope to finish building the game alongside the community so we can build the greatest VR survival game together! \ud83d\udcaa</p>",
